{"title":"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/8/14898526f0613bf783937e1b129117ad71950d85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(0, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/d/bedeede68ac7e044ec767287ba9b91b7e66d49b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(4, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/606f9f1d18dc652d6b3515fa5c8a66ebbf531340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(1, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />. The line with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536a3bcee68d746371a8631e091ea01c6dc19835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /> is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> and passes through the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7c52aff9dd9987076c0ac4fecccf59b6ed8bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Going from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> gives a change in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/0/ca02cb65751cbc3b735e008c508c44e53f84de96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - 0 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> and a change in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/682ef44a1c940053820094d8f726da9b3dec8386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 - 0 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, the slope of the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/c/9ec6788809c809c37a6bbb42482510ca5118471e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{1} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />. Since the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536a3bcee68d746371a8631e091ea01c6dc19835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /> is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />, this means that the line is of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18d878515c30bb28e0ea37da6611fc38ccc6f8ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Next, the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7c52aff9dd9987076c0ac4fecccf59b6ed8bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/5/6a584e454511b38b35d3377c2396843071d10e3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{4 + 1}{2}, \\frac{0 + 2}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/f/2ff9b67c1c1a836c3970e0c13ad8a2f4486ea68c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{5}{2}, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"46\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18d878515c30bb28e0ea37da6611fc38ccc6f8ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" /> passes through this point, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1da8012003228ea9a99f915f092e4c0b367c029b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 = 2 \\times \\frac{5}{2} + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce3318ef8f7b8a6b40dbbc4776253cc481ff8097.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 5 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62e7dac38fc1cbc4af15142749ea0e60b5ffea1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1 - 5 = \\boxed{-4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"133\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC\" title=\"2021 CSMC\">2021 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018063546\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 149/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4391/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.819      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    7.819      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37387:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018063546 and revision id 289009. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}